<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">

  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"
  >

  <title>Website Maintenance | Forged Digital Creations</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Keep your website updated, accurate, polished, and ready to grow with ongoing website maintenance from Forged Digital Creations."
  >

  <meta name="theme-color" content="#05070b">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;

      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;

      color: #ffffff;

      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 15% 10%,
          rgba(73, 96, 255, 0.16),
          transparent 32%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 85% 25%,
          rgba(157, 67, 255, 0.14),
          transparent 30%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          #05070b,
          #07090e 50%,
          #040609
        );
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";

      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;

      z-index: -4;
      pointer-events: none;

      opacity: 0.22;

      background-image:
        linear-gradient(
          rgba(255,255,255,0.018) 1px,
          transparent 1px
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,0.018) 1px,
          transparent 1px
        );

      background-size: 55px 55px;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    ::selection {
      background: rgba(136,112,255,0.45);
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .ambient {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;

      overflow: hidden;
      pointer-events: none;

      z-index: -3;
    }

    .orb {
      position: absolute;

      border-radius: 50%;

      filter: blur(100px);
      opacity: 0.25;

      animation: drift 15s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .orb-one {
      width: 450px;
      height: 450px;

      left: -180px;
      top: -130px;

      background: #536cff;
    }

    .orb-two {
      width: 500px;
      height: 500px;

      right: -250px;
      top: 35%;

      background: #9148ff;

      animation-delay: -5s;
    }

    .orb-three {
      width: 350px;
      height: 350px;

      left: 38%;
      bottom: -210px;

      background: #2857ff;

      animation-delay: -9s;
    }

    @keyframes drift {
      0%,
      100% {
        transform:
          translate3d(0, 0, 0)
          scale(1);
      }

      50% {
        transform:
          translate3d(35px, -30px, 0)
          scale(1.08);
      }
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .gradient-text {
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          #8298ff,
          #ab6aff,
          #d4d9ff
        );

      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;

      color: transparent;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 8px;

      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding: 8px 13px;

      border-radius: 999px;

      color: #b8c1ff;

      background:
        rgba(102,113,255,0.07);

      border:
        1px solid rgba(128,143,255,0.27);

      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow-dot {
      width: 7px;
      height: 7px;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background: #8b91ff;

      box-shadow:
        0 0 12px rgba(139,145,255,0.8);
    }

    .btn {
      min-height: 52px;

      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;

      gap: 9px;

      padding: 0 23px;

      border-radius: 12px;

      font-weight: 800;

      transition:
        transform 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease,
        border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      color: #ffffff;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          #6d84ff,
          #965dff
        );

      box-shadow:
        0 12px 38px rgba(91,87,255,0.25);
    }

    .btn-secondary {
      color: #d4d9e2;

      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.035);

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.11);
    }

    header {
      position: fixed;

      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      top: 0;

      z-index: 1000;

      background:
        rgba(5,7,11,0.82);

      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);

      border-bottom:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.065);
    }

    nav {
      min-height: 78px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;

      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 12px;

      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      position: relative;

      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;

      display: grid;
      place-items: center;

      border-radius: 12px;

      color: #ffffff;

      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 900;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          #788dff,
          #8f5fff 55%,
          #5526bb
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);

      box-shadow:
        0 0 24px rgba(109,111,255,0.38),
        inset 0 1px 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    }

    .brand-mark::after {
      content: "";

      position: absolute;
      inset: 4px;

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);

      border-radius: 9px;
    }

    .brand-text {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;

      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .brand-main {
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 1.3px;
    }

    .brand-sub {
      margin-top: 3px;

      color: #828b99;

      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 2.6px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 20px;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      color: #bfc5d0;

      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }

    .nav-cta {
      min-height: 42px;

      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;

      padding: 0 16px;

      border-radius: 11px;

      color: #ffffff !important;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          90deg,
          rgba(109,132,255,0.22),
          rgba(150,93,255,0.22)
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(132,129,255,0.28);
    }

    .hero {
      padding:
        155px 0
        90px;

      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 960px;

      margin:
        0 auto
        22px;

      font-size:
        clamp(50px, 8vw, 86px);

      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -3.5px;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 740px;

      margin: 0 auto;

      color: #9ba3b0;

      font-size:
        clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;

      gap: 12px;

      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .status-strip {
      max-width: 920px;

      margin:
        55px auto
        0;

      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3, 1fr);

      overflow: hidden;

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

      border-radius: 18px;

      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    }

    .status-item {
      padding: 23px;

      border-right:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }

    .status-item:last-child {
      border-right: 0;
    }

    .status-item strong {
      display: block;

      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .status-item span {
      display: block;

      margin-top: 3px;

      color: #7f8794;

      font-size: 12px;
    }

    section {
      padding: 95px 0;
    }

    .section-head {
      max-width: 760px;

      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .section-kicker {
      color: #8f9cff;

      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;

      letter-spacing: 1.8px;

      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      margin-top: 10px;

      font-size:
        clamp(36px, 6vw, 58px);

      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .section-head p {
      margin-top: 16px;

      color: #929aa7;

      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .care-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3, 1fr);

      gap: 16px;
    }

    .care-card {
      min-height: 245px;

      padding: 27px;

      border-radius: 20px;

      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.025);

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.075);
    }

    .care-icon {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;

      display: grid;
      place-items: center;

      border-radius: 12px;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(109,132,255,0.18),
          rgba(150,93,255,0.12)
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(129,137,255,0.19);

      color: #b8c1ff;

      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .care-card h3 {
      margin-top: 24px;

      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .care-card p {
      margin-top: 8px;

      color: #858e9b;

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .plans {
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          transparent,
          rgba(102,85,255,0.045),
          transparent
        );
    }

    .plan-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3,1fr);

      gap: 18px;
    }

    .plan {
      position: relative;

      padding: 30px;

      border-radius: 22px;

      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.025);

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .plan.featured {
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(104,112,255,0.13),
          rgba(145,85,255,0.05)
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(127,138,255,0.31);

      box-shadow:
        0 20px 55px rgba(81,64,255,0.12);
    }

    .popular {
      position: absolute;

      top: 16px;
      right: 16px;

      padding: 6px 9px;

      border-radius: 999px;

      background:
        rgba(122,114,255,0.16);

      color: #b9c0ff;

      border:
        1px solid rgba(129,137,255,0.24);

      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 900;

      letter-spacing: 1px;

      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .plan-label {
      color: #8d99ff;

      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 900;

      letter-spacing: 1.5px;

      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .plan h3 {
      margin-top: 12px;

      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .plan-price {
      margin-top: 15px;

      font-size: 38px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .plan-price small {
      color: #717a87;

      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .plan > p {
      margin-top: 13px;

      color: #929aa7;

      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .plan-list {
      display: grid;

      gap: 10px;

      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .plan-list div {
      color: #c7ccd5;

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .plan-list div::before {
      content: "✓";

      margin-right: 8px;

      color: #9aa4ff;

      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .plan .btn {
      width: 100%;

      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .included-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(2,1fr);

      gap: 18px;
    }

    .included-card {
      padding: 28px;

      border-radius: 20px;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,0.04),
          rgba(255,255,255,0.015)
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.075);
    }

    .included-card h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
    }

    .included-card p {
      margin-top: 9px;

      color: #8c94a1;

      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .included-list {
      margin-top: 20px;

      display: grid;

      gap: 10px;
    }

    .included-list div {
      color: #c7ccd5;

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .included-list div::before {
      content: "→";

      margin-right: 8px;

      color: #8d99ff;

      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .comparison {
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    .comparison-box {
      overflow: hidden;

      border-radius: 22px;

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);

      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    }

    .comparison-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        1.5fr repeat(3,1fr);

      min-height: 58px;

      border-bottom:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .comparison-row:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }

    .comparison-row > div {
      padding: 16px 18px;

      display: flex;
      align-items: center;

      color: #aeb4bf;

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .comparison-row > div:not(:last-child) {
      border-right:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .comparison-head {
      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .comparison-head > div {
      color: #ffffff;

      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .comparison-feature {
      color: #d6dae2 !important;

      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .yes {
      color: #b7c0ff !important;

      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .muted {
      color: #707886 !important;
    }

    .one-time {
      padding-top: 30px;
    }

    .one-time-box {
      padding: 40px;

      border-radius: 22px;

      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;

      gap: 30px;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(255,255,255,0.04),
          rgba(255,255,255,0.015)
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .one-time-copy {
      max-width: 680px;
    }

    .one-time-copy h3 {
      font-size: 30px;

      line-height: 1.05;
    }

    .one-time-copy p {
      margin-top: 11px;

      color: #8f97a4;
    }

    .one-time-price {
      flex-shrink: 0;

      text-align: right;
    }

    .one-time-price span {
      display: block;

      color: #747c89;

      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;

      letter-spacing: 1px;

      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .one-time-price strong {
      display: block;

      margin-top: 2px;

      font-size: 30px;
    }

    .process-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns:
        repeat(4,1fr);

      gap: 14px;
    }

    .process-card {
      padding: 25px;

      border-radius: 18px;

      background:
        rgba(255,255,255,0.022);

      border:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }

    .process-number {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;

      display: grid;
      place-items: center;

      border-radius: 50%;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          #6f84ff,
          #985eff
        );

      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .process-card h3 {
      margin-top: 24px;

      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .process-card p {
      margin-top: 8px;

      color: #858e9b;

      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .cta-box {
      padding: 60px;

      border-radius: 27px;

      text-align: center;

      background:
        linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          rgba(104,112,255,0.15),
          rgba(145,85,255,0.06)
        );

      border:
        1px solid rgba(127,138,255,0.28);

      box-shadow:
        0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }

    .cta-box h2 {
      max-width: 800px;

      margin: 0 auto;

      font-size:
        clamp(40px,6vw,64px);

      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -2px;
    }

    .cta-box p {
      max-width: 650px;

      margin:
        17px auto
        0;

      color: #929aa7;
    }

    .cta-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;

      gap: 12px;

      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 35px 0;

      border-top:
        1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);

      color: #737c89;

      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .footer-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;

      flex-wrap: wrap;

      gap: 15px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 950px) {
      .care-grid,
      .plan-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .included-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .process-grid {
        grid-template-columns:
          repeat(2,1fr);
      }

      .comparison-row {
        grid-template-columns:
          1.2fr repeat(3,1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .nav-links a:not(.nav-cta) {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        padding-top: 130px;
      }

      .status-strip {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .status-item {
        border-right: 0;

        border-bottom:
          1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      }

      .status-item:last-child {
        border-bottom: 0;
      }

      .comparison-box {
        overflow-x: auto;
      }

      .comparison-row {
        min-width: 720px;
      }

      .one-time-box {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .one-time-price {
        text-align: left;
      }

      .cta-box {
        padding: 40px 24px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .container {
        width:
          calc(100% - 24px);
      }

      .brand-main {
        font-size: 12px;
      }

      .brand-sub {
        font-size: 7px;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 39px;
        height: 39px;
      }

      .nav-cta {
        padding: 0 12px;

        font-size: 11px;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        letter-spacing: -2.5px;
      }

      .hero-actions,
      .cta-actions {
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .hero-actions .btn,
      .cta-actions .btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .process-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *,
      *::before,
      *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="ambient">
    <div class="orb orb-one"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-two"></div>
    <div class="orb orb-three"></div>
  </div>


  <header>

    <div class="container">

      <nav>

        <a
          href="index.html"
          class="brand"
        >

          <div class="brand-mark">
            F
          </div>

          <div class="brand-text">

            <span class="brand-main">
              FORGED DIGITAL
            </span>

            <span class="brand-sub">
              CREATIONS
            </span>

          </div>

        </a>


        <div class="nav-links">

          <a href="index.html">
            Home
          </a>

          <a href="services.html">
            Services
          </a>

          <a href="portfolio.html">
            Portfolio
          </a>

          <a
            href="quote.html"
            class="nav-cta"
          >
            Start a Project
          </a>

        </div>

      </nav>

    </div>

  </header>


  <main>

    <!-- HERO -->

    <section class="hero">

      <div class="container">

        <div class="eyebrow">

          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>

          Website Maintenance

        </div>


        <h1>

          Launch day is not the

          <span class="gradient-text">
            finish line.
          </span>

        </h1>


        <p>

          Businesses change.
          Pricing changes.
          Services change.
          Photos get outdated.
          Website maintenance keeps your site accurate,
          polished,
          and useful without making you wrestle with code.

        </p>


        <div class="hero-actions">

          <a
            href="#plans"
            class="btn btn-primary"
          >
            View Maintenance Plans ↓
          </a>

          <a
            href="quote.html"
            class="btn btn-secondary"
          >
            Ask About Management
          </a>

        </div>


        <div class="status-strip">

          <div class="status-item">

            <strong>
              Stay Current
            </strong>

            <span>
              Keep services, pricing, and information accurate
            </span>

          </div>


          <div class="status-item">

            <strong>
              Stay Polished
            </strong>

            <span>
              Small issues do not pile up over time
            </span>

          </div>


          <div class="status-item">

            <strong>
              Stay Flexible
            </strong>

            <span>
              Add new content as your business grows
            </span>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </section>


    <!-- WHAT WE HANDLE -->

    <section>

      <div class="container">

        <div class="section-head">

          <div class="section-kicker">
            What We Handle
          </div>

          <h2>
            The little changes that keep your website from getting stale.
          </h2>

          <p>
            Maintenance is built around the updates
